---

Third-party components. This repository builds on, and in places adapts code from,
Splatter Image (Szymanowicz et al.), 3D Gaussian Splatting and its differentiable
rasterizer (Kerbl et al.), Diffusion Autoencoders (Preechakul et al.), StyleGAN2/3
(NVIDIA), CATSplat, gs2mesh, and -- for the rebuttal comparisons only -- pi-GAN,
3D GAN Inversion, nerf-from-image, FINV and Equilibrium Matching. Those projects are
NOT vendored here; each remains under its own license and must be obtained from its
upstream repository. The 3D Gaussian Splatting rasterizer in particular is available
under a non-commercial research license from its authors.
